WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Maria: New joiners in the stores take about six weeks before they can run a till on their own.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Nikos: The laptops arrive late, sometimes a week after the start date, IT says it is procurement.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Maria: We tried a buddy system in 2024 but nobody owned it and it [inaudible] after the summer.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Eleni: HR sends the welcome pack, but the store managers never see it, so the first day is improvised?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Nikos: The COO wants this fixed before the three new stores open in spring.
